sion structures? (need to check)\n   - ✓ Warning signs under overhead facilities? (need to check)\n   - ✓ Prohibition on materials/spoils in transmission easement? (need to check)\n\n2. **EL-1.19** - Construction plans should demonstrate 25-ft access corridor with 16-ft vertical clearance (need to check)\n\n\n3. **EL-1.20** - Demolition plan should include caution note for at-grade utility appurtenances (need to check)\n4. **EL-1.21** - Field verification of utility separations and clearances during construction (need to check)\n5. **EL-1.25** - Staging/spoils areas should not overlap with transmission easement (need to check)\n\nI need to review the demolition plan on Sheet 8 and examine the staging/construction documents more carefully to verify these requirements are addressed.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2524,"cache_read_input_tokens":55411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2524},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24aa3565-6e12-4421-aab9-b461d3b546f4","uuid":"1708689d-58d6-42c9-8d47-c7747cc3afe3"}
