heet?\n4. Are there any utility poles shown near or adjacent to the site boundaries?\n5. What is the relationship between any shown utility infrastructure and the transmission easement mentioned in the general notes?\n\nReport what you actually see on the plan - specific locations, dimensions, and clearances depicted."}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-EsZNvRcojJcAtNJdQ5D1qNkL","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Thu, 23 Apr 2026 13:45:14 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"cle1::cle1::lr4qh-1776951859399-4c381db59d48"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of the provided Preliminary Electrical Design Plan, here are the answers to your questions:\n\n**1. What overhead electrical utilities or poles are shown on this sheet, if any? Where are they located relative to the buildings?**\nOverhead electrical utilities are indicated by a line labeled **\"- OHE -\"** located along the far western edge of the drawing (left side), running generally parallel to \"Valley View Road\". This overhead line is located entirely outside the pri