ement shown."}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-NaVLi3OnzyRSLJRZjWEbWTIM","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Thu, 23 Apr 2026 13:45:21 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"cle1::cle1::gftn4-1776951892808-4aa677575286"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful visual analysis of the provided site plan document (\"Sheet 2 of 39\"), here are the answers to your specific questions:\n\n**1. Easements Depicted on the Plat**\nThere are three specific easements explicitly labeled on this plat:\n\n*   **Public Utility Easement (P.U.E.)**\n    *   **Description/Label:** \"5' P.U.E. (Exist)\"\n    *   **Width:** 5 feet\n    *   **Location:** Runs along the entire northern boundary line of both LOT 1 and LOT 2, adjacent to the \"CORTEZ HEIGHTS\" property line.\n*   **Drainage Easement**\n    *   **Description/Label:** \"26' Drainage Easement (Existing)\"\n    *   **Width:** 26 feet\n    *   **Location:** Located within the northern portion of LOT 2.\n*   **Wastewater Easement**\n    *   **Description/Label:** \"10' Wastewater Easement\" (Text is sl