{"level":30,"time":1776951923400,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":2,"prompt":"Examine the plat drawing. Document all existing recorded easements shown (drainage, public utility, wastewater, electric). List the width, orientation, and location of each easement. Identify which easements run across the property and which are along property boundaries. Note if the two recorded easements mentioned in the site facts (Greenbelt Access & Use Easement 2010070731 and City Drainage Easement 2011021137) are depicted on this plat.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful visual analysis of the provided plat drawing titled \"MECEY SUBDIVISION\" (dated 1975), here is the documentation of the easements depicted:\n\n### Existing Recorded Easements Shown on Plat\n\n**1. Northern Boundary Electric Easement**\n*   **Exact Label(s):** \"Exist 5' Elec. Easement\" (located on the northern line of LOT 1) and \"5' Elec. Ease\" (located on the northern line of LOT 2).\n*   **Width:** 5' (feet).\n*   **Type:** Electric.\n*   **Orientation/Location:** Runs East-West along the entire northern property line of the subdivision.\n*   **Relationship:** Along property boundary.\n\n**2. Southern Boundary Electric Easement**\n*   **Exact Label(s):** \"Exist 5' Elec. Ease.\" (located on the southern line of LOT 1; the dashed line denoting the easement continues along the southern line of LOT 2).\n*   **Width:** 5' (feet).\n*   **Type:** Electric.\n*   **Orientation/Location:** Runs East-West along the southern property line of the subdivision.\n*   **Relationship:** Along property boundary.\n\n**3. Internal Drainage Easement**\n*   **Exact Label(s):** \"26' Drainage Easement (Existing)\"\n*   **Width:** 26' (feet). Note: The dimension where this easement meets the northern property line is marked \"26.31'\".\n*   **Type:** Drainage.\n*   **Orientation/Location:** Located entirely within LOT 2. It runs roughly North-South, situated on the eastern side of the lot, separating the main body of LOT 2 from Clawson Road.\n*   **Relationship:** Runs *across* the property (specifically across LOT 2).\n\n**4. Eastern Boundary Wastewater Easement**\n*   **Exact Label(s):** \"10' Wastewater Line Easement\"\n*   **Width:** 10' (feet).\n*   **Type:** Wastewater.\n*   **Orientation/Location:** Located on the far eastern edge of LOT 2. It runs roughly North-South, adjacent to the right-of-way for CLAWSON ROAD.\n*   **Relationship:** Along property boundary.\n\n*(Note: There is also a small label reading \"5' Elec. Ease\" pointing to the short angled boundary line at the extreme Northeast corner of Lot 2).*\n\n---\n\n### Verification of Specific Named Easements\n\nYou requested to note if two specific easements are depicted on this plat:\n1.  Greenbelt Access & Use Easement 2010070731\n2.  City Drainage Easement 2011021137\n\n**Findings:**\nA thorough scan of all text, labels, and line work on this document reveals **no mention or depiction** of either the \"Greenbelt Access & Use Easement\", the \"City Drainage Easement\", or their associated document numbers (2010070731 and 2011021137). \n\n*(Contextual note based on visible data: This plat was surveyed and signed in 1975, which explains why easements with document numbers seemingly indicating years 2010 and 2011 are not present on this specific historical document.)*","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1413,"outputTokens":729,"totalTokens":4957,"reasoningTokens":2815},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 1618032]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provide