e of the page), there is a boundary line with a label reading exactly: **\"25' Electric and Telephone Easement\"**. Further up along the eastern edge (near Unit 603), another label reads: **\"5' Electric Easement Vol. 93, Pg. 14 Vol. 73, Pg. 76 P.R.T.C.Tx.\"**\n*   **Southern Boundary**: Running along the lower edge of the site plan, there are labels pointing to a dashed line. One reads exactly: **\"5' Elec. Easement Vol. 69, Pg. 14 & Vol. 73, Pg. 76 P.R.T.C.Tx.\"** Another label near the southeast corner reads exactly: **\"5' Elec. & Tele. Easement Vol. 5468, Pg. 882 D.R.T.C.Tx.\"**\n\n**(3) Spatial relationships between these areas:**\nNone of the staging, storage, or concrete cleanout areas appear to be located within the boundaries of the identified electrical easements.\n*   The **\"Staging and Storage Area\"** and **\"Concrete Truck Cleanout\"** are positioned exclusively on the far **western** boundary of the project site.\n*   The identified **electrical easements** run exclusively along the **eastern** and **southern** boundaries of the project site.\n*   Therefore, they are physically separated by the entire width/depth of the proposed townhome development footprint (Buildings 2, 4, 3, 5, and 6) and do not overlap.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1412,"outputTokens":597,"totalTokens":3562,"reasoningTokens":1553},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2361176]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than g