{"level":30,"time":1776952023183,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01BSQVXAfYCLezDmvfEUagba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! So:\n1. Sheet 3 has NO site plan drawing - it's just text notes\n2. The extensive \"Electric Transmission Notes\" are general project-wide notes that don't have specific locations shown\n3. There's no visual indication of where transmission facilities are located\n\nLet me check if there's a specific transmission easement shown on any other sheet. Let me look back at the easements mentioned in facts.md and see if a transmission easement was mentioned.\n\nFrom facts.md, the easements listed are:\n- Greenbelt Access & Use Easement\n- City of Austin Drainage Easement  \n- 10' Wastewater Easement\n- 25' Drainage Easement (Cortez Heights plat)\n- 7.5' Public Utility Easement (Cortez Heights)\n- 10' Drainage Easement (Trico Subd)\n- 5' Electric Easements (×2)\n- 7.5' Public Utility Easement\n- Plus others mentioned on site plan\n\nNO transmission easement is mentioned in facts.md.\n\nYet Sheet 3 has 16 notes about transmission requirements. This is suspicious - are these notes applicable to this project, or are they standard boilerplate notes that apply when transmission facilities are present?\n\nLooking back at the vision output from Sheet 3, I see note 1 says \"No trees shall be planted within the transmission easement\" - this implies there IS a transmission easement. But it's not shown on the site plan, not mentioned in facts.md, and not specifically located in the notes.\n\nThis could be a deficiency - the notes reference transmission clearance requirements but don't clearly show where transmission facilities are located or whether they actually exist on/near the site.\n\nLet me now review all the site plan sheets to see if transmission easements or facilities are shown anywhere. Let me check the plat sheet (Sheet 2).","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1149,"cache_read_input_tokens":60611,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1149},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a849ead6-fbef-4e89-ab5d-465127c74861","uuid":"26dd43a9-071b-4308-a5d7-d2a9a888c558"}
