{"level":30,"time":1776952028357,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"3.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_016SY1AUvyrBUpuwkMuEpYbW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018tzk1wLYKmHkvaA1ZWgSv6","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"grouping":"3","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-3.4","status":"fail","codeCitations":["AEDC 1.16.0(7)"],"applicableAreas":["General Notes Sheet"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":3}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan does not include a note stating that the site lies within the Austin Energy service area. This is a required site-specific plan note per AEDC 1.16.0(7) for all sites within Austin Energy's service territory."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-3.5","status":"fail","codeCitations":["AEDC 1.16.0(7)"],"applicableAreas":["General Notes Sheet"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":3}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Plans do not include the required developer responsibility note stating that the developer is responsible for designing and constructing all conduit and related infrastructure to current Austin Energy Electric Service Standards, including conductor installation costs, and for coordinating with other utilities to resolve conflicts."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-3.29","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM 2.5.1.F"],"applicableAreas":["Cover Sheet"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":1}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Additional Review Acknowledgement table is not present on the cover sheet. This table must list all applicable external reviews, approvals, and permits including: TxDOT permit, railroad permit, gas company permit, easement acquisition, county approval, water district or MUD approval, Texas Department of Health approval, TCEQ approval, non-occupancy letter, service extension approval, and Planning and Development Review Department approvals."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-3.2","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Entire project"],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Austin Energy Utility (AEU) clearance or approval has not been located in the submittal package. No clearance letter from Austin Energy confirming service availability is present in the supplementary documents provided, though Austin Energy noted that the completeness check is complete."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-3.1","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["AEDC 1.4.2.1"],"applicableAreas":["Electrical infrastructure"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Electric Service Planning Application (ESPA) approval is not documented in the plan set. While new Austin Energy electrical service is clearly proposed (transformers, meters, pull boxes, and underground lines shown on Sheet 21), the ESPA submission and approval status cannot be verified from the current submittal. ESPA is normally submitted after site plan approval per the regulatory exception; current status cannot be determined from available documents."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-3.30","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Addressing Standards, Streets"],"applicableAreas":["Building addresses"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":29}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"While Sheet 29 shows an addressing plan with all proposed unit addresses (Units 101-104, 201-206, 301-305, 401-405, 501-504, 601-604, 701-705, 801-806), there is no evidence in the submittal that these street addresses or unit numbers have been reserved with 911 Addressing/Address Management Services prior to site plan approval."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-3.31","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Addressing Standards, Introduction"],"applicableAreas":["Address plan"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":29}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No evidence of an approved addressing plan from Address Management Services is present in the submittal. Sheet 29 shows an addressing plan layout, but there is no separate approval documentation confirming that Address Management Services has formally approved the addressing scheme. Note that an Address Validation Letter (AVL), if issued, is distinct from an approved addressing plan."}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1506,"cache_read_input_tokens":76289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1506},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b9a1b17-16ac-4098-9a13-aa52e9d6aac3","uuid":"3e23bf97-07b5-422b-9cc2-5cbc01b1bf78"}
