{"level":30,"time":1776952112796,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Rnd8hLn6iBPDZufVNaCa9D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! So the plat (Sheet 2) shows:\n- 5' P.U.E. (Public Utility Easement) on north and south boundaries\n- 5' Electric Easement on south boundary\n- 26' Drainage Easement on Lot 2\n- 10' Wastewater Easement on Lot 2\n- NO transmission easement is shown on the plat\n\nBut Sheet 3 has 16 detailed notes about transmission facilities, clearances, and easement restrictions. This is a major discrepancy.\n\nThe transmission notes in Sheet 3 refer to:\n1. \"transmission easement\" (note 1, 7)\n2. \"transmission structures\" (notes 2, 4, 13, 14)\n3. \"transmission wire\" (notes 6, 10)\n4. \"electric transmission facilities\" (notes 1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 9, 10, 11, 12, 14, 16)\n\nBut none of these are shown on the actual site plans or the plat.\n\nThis could mean:\nA) There is a transmission easement that's not being shown on the current plan set (missing/not depicted - that's a deficiency)\nB) The transmission notes are boilerplate/standard notes that were included but don't actually apply to this project\nC) The transmission facilities are off-site but in proximity\n\nNow let me think about applicability:\n\nThe grouping covers electrical clearances and applies when:\n- Overhead utilities are present on or adjacent to the site\n- Underground utility crossings are proposed\n- Demolition activities occur near transmission lines\n- etc.\n\nFrom what I can see:\n1. There ARE overhead electric lines along the site boundaries (OHE shown on electrical plan)\n2. There are NO transmission facilities shown (despite extensive transmission notes)\n3. Valley View Road is a LOCAL STREET, not a CTC or Urban Roadway - so the LDC § 2.2.2.B.3 overhead utility zone requirement (EL-1.1) does NOT apply\n\n\n4. The site has various utility easements documented on the plat, but notably no transmission easement appears. The overhead electric line shown on the electrical plan runs along the western and southern boundaries, but clearance dimensions from these conductors aren't specified on the plans. EL-1.1 doesn't apply since Valley View Road is classified as a local street, not a CTC or Urban Roadway. EL-1.2 and EL-1.3 regarding horizontal and radial clearances from overhead conductors could be relevant given the OHE presence, but the plans don't show these measurements.\n\nFor the vault requirement (EL-1.4), while utility notes reference a meter vault, its location relative to transmission structures isn't clearly documented. The clearance requirements in EL-1.5 and EL-1.6 also cannot be verified since no clearance dimensions appear anywhere on the electrical plan, despite transformer pads and electrical meters being shown. Service drop clearances over truck routes (EL-1.7) similarly lack the necessary dimensional documentation.\n\nThe demolition plan (Sheet 8) should address transmission safety requirements, though this may not apply if no transmission facilities are actually present on the site. The transmission easement mentioned on Sheet 3 isn't graphically depicted, making it impossible to verify whether the required 25-ft-wide access corridor with 16-ft vertical clearance has been properly planned.\n\nSheet 8 needs to include a caution note for at-grade utility appurtenances, and the general notes should document field verification requirements for utility separations. However, the plans completely lack graphically delineated overhead clearance zones or height limit lines for any electrical utilities—both critical omissions that represent failures to meet code requirements.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2633,"cache_read_input_tokens":61760,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2633},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a849ead6-fbef-4e89-ab5d-465127c74861","uuid":"76bd5115-3994-4ef5-ada1-98a43cd0bb37"}
