{"level":30,"time":1776952168935,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01WjSyfdubgr6ysq47AZJepE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect. I have completed the review of grouping 2 (Underground Utility Routing and Placement) for the Valley View Townhomes site plan. \n\nMy findings identify 5 deficiencies:\n1. EL-2.11 (NOT-VERIFIABLE) - AW utilities in planting zones\n2. EL-2.16 (FAIL) - Missing required easement depictions and AE easements for transformers\n3. EL-2.17 (NOT-VERIFIABLE) - Private utilities in ROW status unclear\n4. EL-2.19 (NOT-VERIFIABLE) - Public utility termination method not documented\n5. EL-2.21 (NOT-VERIFIABLE) - Power pole relocation coordination not documented\n\nThe most significant finding is EL-2.16, which represents both missing critical recorded easements and missing AE easement documentation for transformer pads.\n\nThe task is complete.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6935,"cache_read_input_tokens":73011,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6935},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f19fb8e-f97f-429a-bf6c-feca3089c5bd","uuid":"9bb800a8-bceb-479d-a3c7-967e0e2c119f"}
{"level":30,"time":1776952171069,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01YHMPvkP8x8AoF6X3fL3kDj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Review Complete\n\nI have completed the comprehensive site plan review for **Grouping EL-1: Overhead and Vertical Electrical Clearances**. \n\n### Key Findings Summary\n\nThis review identified **9 deficiencies** across the site plan documents:\n\n**Critical Deficiencies (Fail Status):**\n- **EL-1.18**: Demolition plan lacks required transmission line safety measures (pre-construction safety meeting, barricades, warning signs, spoils restrictions)\n- **EL-1.19**: Transmission ROW access corridor (25-ft width, 16-ft vertical clearance) not delineated on plans\n- **EL-1.26**: No electrical clearance zones graphically shown on plans\n- **EL-1.27**: No height limit lines shown for transmission conductor clearance envelopes\n\n**Not-Verifiable Deficiencies:**\n- **EL-1.9**: AE underground facility separations at utility crossings not documented\n- **EL-1.10**: Joint trench agreements with AE not documented\n- **EL-1.12**: Utility crossing method (open-cut vs. trenchless) and clearances not identified\n- **EL-1.13**: Encasement specifications for water line crossing under Valley View Road not provided\n- **EL-1.22**: SCM staging area vertical clearance not demonstrated\n- **EL-1.25**: Staging area overlap with transmission easement cannot be verified (easement not delineated)\n\n### Primary Issues\n\n1. **Transmission Infrastructure Not Delineated**: While Sheet 3 General Notes extensively reference transmission lines, structures, and a 25-foot clearance zone, the transmission easement is not graphically depicted on any site plan sheets.\n\n2. **Demolition Plan Gaps**: The demolition sequence notes do not incorporate the transmission safety requirements (48-hour pre-construction meeting, 10-ft barricades, warning signs, spoils restrictions).\n\n3. **Utility Crossing Specifications Missing**: Water utility crossing under Valley View Road and crossing existing wastewater/gas lines lack method designation and labeled clearance dimensions.\n\n4. **Staging Area Clearances Undocumented**: The staging area shown on Sheet 5 has no vertical clearance dimensions and its relationship to the transmission easement cannot be verified.\n\nAll deficiencies have been documented in the structured output with specific sheet references, code citations, and action comments."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3345,"cache_read_input_tokens":76569,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3345},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d4a1fc80-d233-40ef-93cf-fcf0c529f6de","uuid":"d28d2a11-9a4e-49af-b2db-dd7992440162"}
{"level":30,"time":1776952171116,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":442290,"duration_api_ms":174279,"num_turns":27,"result":"## Review Complete\n\nI have completed the comprehensive site plan review for **Grouping EL-1: Overhead and Vertical Electrical Clearances**. \n\n### Key Findings Summary\n\nThis review identified **9 deficiencies** across the site plan documents:\n\n**Critical Deficiencies (Fail Status):**\n- **EL-1.18**: Demolition plan lacks required transmission line safety measures (pre-construction safety meeting, barricades, warning signs, spoils restrictions)\n- **EL-1.19**: Transmission ROW access corridor (25-ft width, 16-ft vertical clearance) not delineated on plans\n- **EL-1.26**: No electrical clearance zones graphically shown on plans\n- **EL-1.27**: No height limit lines shown for transmission conductor clearance envelopes\n\n**Not-Verifiable Deficiencies:**\n- **EL-1.9**: AE underground facility separations at utility crossings not documented\n- **EL-1.10**: Joint trench agreements with AE not documented\n- **EL-1.12**: Utility crossing method (open-cut vs. trenchless) and clearances not identified\n- **EL-1.13**: Encasement specifications for water line crossing under Valley View Road not provided\n- **EL-1.22**: SCM staging area vertical clearance not demonstrated\n- **EL-1.25**: Staging area overlap with transmission easement cannot be verified (easement not delineated)\n\n### Primary Issues\n\n1. **Transmission Infrastructure Not Delineated**: While Sheet 3 General Notes extensively reference transmission lines, structures, and a 25-foot clearance zone, the transmission easement is not graphically depicted on any site plan sheets.\n\n2. **Demolition Plan Gaps**: The demolition sequence notes do not incorporate the transmission safety requirements (48-hour pre-construction meeting, 10-ft barricades, warning signs, spoils restrictions).\n\n3. **Utility Crossing Specifications Missing**: Water utility crossing under Valley View Road and crossing existing wastewater/gas lines lack method designation and labeled clearance dimensions.\n\n4. **Staging Area Clearances Undocumented**: The staging area shown on Sheet 5 has no vertical clearance dimensions and its relationship to the transmission easement cannot be verified.\n\nAll deficiencies have been documented in the structured output with specific sheet references, code citations, and action comments.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d4a1fc80-d233-40ef-93cf-fcf0c529f6de","total_cost_usd":0.2709703,"usage":{"input_tokens":132,"cache_creation_input_tokens":79914,"cache_read_input_tokens":932508,"output_tokens":15539,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":79914,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":132,"outputTokens":15539,"cacheReadInputTokens":932508,"cacheCreationInputTokens":79914,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2709703,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"grouping":"1","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.9","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM 1.10.5.A"],"applicableAreas":["Water line crossings with existing utilities in ROW"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":20},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Water utility crossing shown on Sheet 20 crossing existing wastewater and gas lines, but no crossing detail identifies AE underground facility proximity or demonstrates 12-inch clearance. Verify that water line crossings do not impact AE underground conduit; if AE underground is present at these crossing locations, clearance dimensions must be labeled."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM 1.10.5.A"],"applicableAreas":["Underground electrical infrastructure"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Underground electrical infrastructure shown on Sheet 21; water and wastewater utilities shown on Sheet 19. The plans do not clearly identify whether any non-AE utilities are proposed in joint trenches with AE underground conduit, or indicate if a written joint-trench agreement with Austin Energy is on file."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.12","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM 2.9.2.B.17","UCM 2.9.1.B.3"],"applicableAreas":["Water utility tap in ROW crossing existing wastewater and gas lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":20}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 20 profile shows water line (Wtr-Ln-A) crossing existing wastewater and gas lines, but the crossing method (trenchless vs. open-cut) is not identified on the plan or profile. Vertical separation distances are not labeled. Without crossing method designation and labeled clearance dimensions, the applicable separation standard cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.13","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM 2.9.1.D"],"applicableAreas":["Water utility tap crossing under Valley View Road"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":20}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 20 profile shows water line crossing under Valley View Road (public roadway), but encasement specifications (material type, diameter, extent) are not provided on the crossing detail sheets. Confirm encasement piping specifications for utilities crossing under the roadway per UCM 2.9.1.D."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.18","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM 1.14.9"],"applicableAreas":["Demolition activities adjacent to transmission easement and transmission structures"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":8},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":3}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Demolition plan (Sheet 8) Site Demolition Notes do not address required transmission line safety clearances detailed in Sheet 3 Electric Transmission Notes. Missing: (1) pre-construction safety meeting requirement with Austin Energy 48 hours before work commencement, (2) barricade requirement 10 feet from transmission structures, (3) warning signs under overhead transmission facilities, and (4) prohibition on materials or spoils storage within transmission easement."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.19","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM 1.14.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transmission ROW access corridor"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":5},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Construction plans do not demonstrate maintenance of a 25-foot-wide access corridor with minimum 16-foot vertical clearance along the transmission ROW. Transmission easement boundaries and access corridor requirements are not graphically delineated on the site plan or erosion control plan."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.22","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["DCM 1.2.4.E.2.e"],"applicableAreas":["SCM staging area on western side of site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":5}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 5 shows a 'Staging and Storage Area' on the western side of the site, but no vertical clearance dimensions or annotations are provided. The plan does not demonstrate the 14-foot minimum vertical clearance from existing and proposed vegetation and all other objects above the staging area."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.25","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM 1.14.9"],"applicableAreas":["Staging and storage areas relative to transmission easement"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":5},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":3}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 3 Electric Transmission Notes prohibit staging, spoils, and dumpsters within 25 feet of transmission structures. However, the transmission easement boundaries are not delineated on Sheet 5 (Erosion Control Plan) or Sheet 9 (Site Plan), making it impossible to verify that the shown staging area does not overlap transmission easement or violate 25-foot clearance from transmission structures."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.26","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM 1.10.3","UCM 1.14.3.1"],"applicableAreas":["Entire site with transmission lines and distribution utilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":5}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No electrical clearance zones or envelopes are graphically delineated on any plan sheets. Transmission line safety buffers (including the 25-foot no-dig zone and transmission easement boundaries referenced in Sheet 3 General Notes) are not shown. Distribution overhead conductor clearance envelopes are not graphically represented."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.27","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Transmission easement and transmission structures"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":5},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":3}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No horizontal dashed height limit lines are shown on the site plan or erosion control plan to delineate the overhead transmission conductor clearance envelope boundaries. Transmission structures and easement are referenced in Sheet 3 General Notes but are not graphically depicted with height limit annotations on site plan sheets."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"7aa44f50-3f2e-4edb-94a1-8a8a2918621e"}
