{"level":30,"time":1776952172648,"pid":35263,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":2,"prompt":"I need to identify all easements depicted on this historical Mecey Subdivision plat. Please examine the plat carefully and list every easement that is shown and labeled, including:\n\n1. **Name of easement** (e.g., \"Drainage Easement\", \"Public Utility Easement\", \"Electric Easement\")\n2. **Width of easement** (if labeled, e.g., \"10 feet\", \"25 feet\")\n3. **Location on the plat** (e.g., \"along southern boundary\", \"NE corner\", \"across the interior\")\n4. **Reference document** (if shown, e.g., \"Vol. XX, Page XX\", \"Instrument #XXXXXXX\")\n5. **Any notes or special restrictions** associated with the easement\n\nPlease be specific about which easements ARE depicted, and note the boundaries and reference documents shown. This is a 1975 plat, so it will show plat-dedicated easements from the original subdivision.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful visual analysis of the provided Mecey Subdivision plat map, here are the explicitly labeled easements depicted on the drawing:\n\n**1. Public Utility Easement (P.U.E.)**\n*   **Name:** P.U.E.\n*   **Width:** 15'\n*   **Location:** Along the northern boundary of Lot 1.\n*   **Reference Document:** Not explicitly labeled with a separate volume/page.\n*   **Notes/Restrictions:** Labeled specifically as \"15' P.U.E. (Exist.)\", indicating it is an existing easement.\n\n**2. Electric Easement (Lot 1)**\n*   **Name:** Elec. Ease. (Electric Easement)\n*   **Width:** 5'\n*   **Location:** Along the southern boundary of Lot 1.\n*   **Reference Document:** Not explicitly labeled.\n*   **Notes/Restrictions:** Labeled as \"Exist. 5' Elec. Ease.\", indicating it is an existing easement.\n\n**3. Electric Easement (Lot 2)**\n*   **Name:** Elec. Ease. (Electric Easement)\n* 